          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why monthly monitoring instead of one-off?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "AI engines drift weekly. An audit is a snapshot in time. Monitoring re-runs the same audit every month so you can see trends — is your visibility improving or declining, which competitors are gaining ground, which sources keep getting cited. You also get instant access to the dashboard to add more brands or run on-demand audits."
          }
        },
